    "body": "Coverity detected a NULL pointer dereference in the function get_last_leader_offset under src/nvim/change.c. From coverity's descripton:\n\nIf the function actually returns a null value, a null pointer dereference will occur. In get_last_leader_offset: Return value of function which returns null is dereferenced without checking\n\nLooking at other parts of the file, there are checks after each usage of vim_strchr() function. Thus adding a missing check in get_last_leader_offset.",
